"Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194554-v57olmu","updated":"20250915194611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Debug.LogWarning"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194551-fg6xwep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194551-fg6xwep","updated":"20250915194551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250915194524-h0uhvq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194524-h0uhvq9","updated":"20250915201527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他们可以用于在 Unity 的控制台中输出打印信息，帮助我们进行项目调试，但是这些API会带来额外的性能开销\n特别是在最终的发布版本中，尽量都不要再使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Debug"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 相关API，避免给我们的最终项目带来额外的开销，影响项目性能表现"}]},{"ID":"20250915194620-0e95syu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915194620-0e95syu","updated":"20250915201920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如何更好的使用 Debug 相关API"}]},{"ID":"20250915194629-gne8thd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194629-gne8thd","updated":"20250915194638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以对 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Debug"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 进行二次封装\n可以让我们更加方便的开关 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Debug"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 相关API的使用\n尽量不影响我们的开发效率"}]},{"ID":"20250915194708-5t7q975","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250915194708-5t7q975","updated":"20250915201920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"using UnityEngine;\n\npublic static class DebugUtil\n{\n    /// \u003csummary\u003e\n    /// 是否是调试模式，可以在发布后修改为false，避免发布后输出Debug信息\n    /// \u003c/summary\u003e\n    private static bool isDebug = true;\n\n    public static void Log(object message)\n    {\n        if (!isDebug)\n            return;\n        Debug.Log(message);\n    }\n\n    public static void LogWarning(object message)\n    {\n        if (!isDebug)\n            return;\n        Debug.LogWarning(message);\n    }\n\n    public static void LogError(object message)\n    {\n        if (!isDebug)\n            return;\n        Debug.LogError(message);\n    }\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}